{"title": "Pope Leo marks US anniversary with migrant appeal", "summary": "Pope Leo has used his first key address to the US to praise the country's history of welcoming migrants, urging Americans to live up to ideals of freedom and equality. The Pope's comments come as the US celebrates its 250th anniversary of independence from Britain. Pope Leo's visit to Lampedusa, an Italian island in the Mediterranean, has been seen as a symbol of his commitment to protecting migrants. The Pope's words have been interpreted as a rebuke to Trump's policies on immigration.", "summary_points": ["Pope Leo praises US history of welcoming immigrants", "The Pope urges Americans to live up to ideals of Declaration of Independence", "Pope Leo defends US immigrant history at 250th anniversary", "The Pope calls for 'moderation' in US public discourse on 250th anniversary", "Pope's visit to Lampedusa seen as symbol of commitment to protecting migrants"], "title_hi": "पोप लियो अमेरिका के 250वें वर्षगांठ पर मigrantों की प्रशंसा करते हैं", "summary_hi": "पोप लियो ने अपने पहले महत्वपूर्ण भाषण के दौरान अमेरिका की स्वतंत्रता के 250वें वर्षगांठ पर मigrantों की प्रशंसा की, अमेरिकियों को स्वतंत्रता और समानता के आदर्शों को पूरा करने का आह्वान किया। पोप लियो के टिप्पणियाँ अमेरिका के 250वें वर्षगांठ के दौरान मानवाधिकारों और स्वतंत्रता की अवधारणाओं पर केंद्रित हैं।", "summary_points_hi": ["पोप लियो ने अमेरिका की मigrantों की प्रशंसा की", "पोप लियो ने अमेरिकियों से स्वतंत्रता और समानता के आदर्शों को पूरा करने का आह्वान किया", "पोप लियो ने अमेरिका के 250वें वर्षगांठ पर मानवाधिकारों की रक्षा की", "पोप लियो ने अमेरिका के स्वतंत्रता दिवस पर चर्चा की", "पोप लियो के लंपेडूसा जाने के रूप में उनके समर्थन को एक प्रतीक के रूप में देखा गया है"], "framing": {"center": "Centrist coverage frames the story as a positive development, highlighting the Pope's praise for US history of welcoming immigrants and his call for Americans to live up to ideals of freedom and equality. However, some outlets note that the Pope's visit has also been seen as a rebuke to Trump's policies."}, "framing_hi": {"center": "केंद्रीय समाचार संगठनों द्वारा इस कहानी को सकारात्मक विकास के रूप में प्रस्तुत किया जाता है, अमेरिका की मानवाधिकारों और स्वतंत्रता की अवधारणाओं पर केंद्रित करते हुए। हालांकि, कुछ समाचार संगठनों ने यह भी ध्यान दिया है कि पोप की यात्रा ट्रंप की नीतियों पर एक विरोध के रूप में देखी गई है।"}, "topic": "International", "region": "World", "image_url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/ed2884d55e646de8408862ed0e2501458ae55cf8/293_0_5906_4725/master/5906.jpg?width=140&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=229c7dfdbc40c46a95abbb8f23f4b1cd", "sources": [{"source": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Pope Leo marks US anniversary with migrant appeal on Lampedusa"}, {"source": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Pope Leo praises US history of welcoming immigrants at 250th anniversary"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxQM0wybEVfeXpEb1ZYWU1xTXEySVdtSXYySDhkOUlDV21HOXNyZ21GekRYNllrNy1LaEdnX3pBUWZTVkpqa2VySEZUbkhjdktpZldqeXRTX043Q0FVOFZFb0lTTk9CczYxUC1RelBsdDBzWDdNYVJwckFGRzJ6RnhBM21pWF9KM1VMRjRVQ1JQR0tudms0b0NxeFl2dkx3MTNGUDgtdEJBRDg3aDItQld4Zk8tRzlJQ2tTaUtnRmRleXBhRU1OQUdaUkJTTFE?oc=5", "headline": "Pope Leo praises US history of welcoming immigrants at 250th anniversary"}, {"source": "The Guardian", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/03/pope-leo-lampedusa-visit-us-250th-anniversary-trump", "headline": "Pope praises US history of welcoming migrants in implicit rebuke to Trump"}, {"source": "Deutsche Welle", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Pope Leo defends US immigrant history at 250th anniversary"}, {"source": "France 24", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "h